{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Ruin Explorers Fam & Ihrie","Ancient curses, enchanted artifacts and plain old fashioned dungeon diving: that’s what Fam and Ihrie do for a living - whenever these lovely young ladies can get someone to pay them for it, that is. As two highly trained magic users with slightly faulty spelling abilities they’re off on a quest for the “Ultimate Power.”  All they have to do is find three artifacts: the Proof Of Royalty, the Sword of Sargus and the Mirror of Truth.\n\n\n\nSo how hard can it be?\n\n\n\n(Source: Maiden Japan)"],"ja":["秘境探検 ファム＆イーリー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1181","ids":{"shikimori":1181,"mal":1181,"anilist":1181,"kodik":"serial-21049"},"kodikIds":["serial-21049"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-21049":"2020-01-11T20:29:20Z"},"title":"Исследователи руин","originalTitle":"Hikyou Tanken Fam & Ihrlie","alt":"Ruin Explorers Ruin Explorers Fam & Ihrie 秘境探検 ファム＆イーリー","description":"Фам и Ири зарабатывают на жизнь, продавая артефакты, найденные в древних руинах. Чтобы избавиться от проклятья, Ири ищет «Абсолютную Власть», запечатанную тремя реликвиями. Однако вскоре оказывается, что не только Фам и Ири разыскивают эти реликвии. И если с одними из конкурентов можно договориться и объединиться, другие не пойдут ни на какие компромиссы.","year":1995,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.75,"popularity":5680,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1181/13142da8596ca19a6425a00b0896f3d0.jpeg","width":275,"height":390},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1181-Aqqpe5eqL7zw.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-l